#
#   agent - HTML::Agent: the agent of a realm, with its event loop
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/HTML/Scripting/Agent.cpp (lines 1-27) and Agent.h (lines
#       1-31). JS::Agent (CanBlock, the agent signifier) is not ported apart from what LibWeb
#       reads: the VM owns one HTML::Agent, whose event loop LibWeb reaches through the
#       relevant agent of an object.
